From: mscharged-port contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Observe exact successful native VI presentation geometry
Upstream-base: d664382f57002fbff143911c81b06b7e7a4b3ab4

Expose a read-only last-successful-Present geometry snapshot for native input.
Retain original VI/GX selection, clocks, field/desktop signal, viewport and
all existing committed/pending/completion semantics. Query performs no SDL,
GPU or VI work and cannot calibrate a retired/no-Present window.

--- a/include/aurora/video.h
+++ b/include/aurora/video.h
@@ -73,6 +73,22 @@
   bool black;
